                                                "sense_id": "c4309c08-0176-3e11-854b-ba610703b696",
                                                "text": "Using the correction of a vector field to characterize isochronicity and explicit computations of this quantity for polynomial vector fields, wa are able to describe a very large class of nonisochronous Hamiltonian system of even degree of degree arbitrary large."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df268a9d-9a78-33ee-a270-b4b72a48d550",
